From 8d03b9efe9433069468088c66a376a5e0b8aabee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] validation: add static UTXO dependency-graph multi-core
 parallel validation

Construct a static topological UTXO dependency wave graph in ConnectBlock
and AcceptRawTxBatch so independent transactions validate in parallel
across worker threads.
